docs {
  ValueSet/$validate-code with the IG's ValueSet `BeUcumAllVS` sent inline (the server does not have the IG).

  Every valid UCUM expression. Annotations such as `{spoon}` and `{lepel}` are valid UCUM, so this allows them. Same content as the FHIR ValueSet `ucum-units`.
}
